  "dct_description_sm": [
    "Historical dataset of Trees in Evanston, Illinois as of 2025. The City of Evanston has inventoried and maintains over 32,000 trees located on City property and in the parkways. The initial data provided on trees located within the City of Evanston was collected in 2014. Maintenance and tree preservation efforts are an ongoing part of the City operations, thus the data contained herein does not represent current figures."
